{"object":"toolset","id":"134","title":"VNMT-v1.3 GALGAME 管理工具——伊恋汉化组","aliases":[],"toolset_type":"launcher","interface_language":"zh-cn","platform":"windows","release_channel":"beta","homepage_urls":[],"author":{"object":"user","id":"135362","name":"FinSAMA","avatar":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/43/f6/43f62977a1c449a1c32c9a1f1b65b65f4c7d7acbecd7d68454cdf83b5307d81f.webp","hash":"43f62977a1c449a1c32c9a1f1b65b65f4c7d7acbecd7d68454cdf83b5307d81f","width":null,"height":null,"thumbhash":null,"sexual":null},"avatar_frame":null},"view_count":298,"download_count":53,"comment_count":0,"favorite_count":1,"practicality_average":5,"practicality_count":1,"practicality_distribution":[0,0,0,0,1],"created_at":"2026-10-05T17:31:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T06:37:38Z","edited_at":"2026-10-07T06:37:38Z","resource_updated_at":"2026-10-07T06:24:34Z","content":{"object":"document","children":[{"object":"heading","depth":2,"anchor":"程序说明","children":[{"object":"text","value":"程序说明"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"VNMT 是一款面向视觉小说游戏的归档与游戏库管理工具。"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"它可以把游戏文件夹制作成单个 FIN 文件，通过虚拟磁盘运行游戏，无需提前将整个游戏解压到硬盘。"}]},{"object":"heading","depth":2,"anchor":"主要功能","children":[{"object":"text","value":"主要功能"}]},{"object":"list","is_ordered":false,"start":null,"is_spread":true,"children":[{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"游戏归档：将游戏文件整理为 FIN 归档，支持压缩、密码加密，也可将归档解压还原。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"游戏启动：在游戏库中选择游戏即可挂载并启动，游戏退出后自动卸载虚拟磁盘。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"游戏管理：支持搜索、分类目录、拖动排序、收藏，以及游戏信息和封面展示。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"补丁加载：添加补丁文件或文件夹后，启动时覆盖对应路径的读取内容，不修改 FIN 原文件。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"数据管理：归档、存档、补丁、映射和游戏信息集中保存在 library 游戏库中，方便整体备份与搬迁。"}]}]}]},{"object":"heading","depth":2,"anchor":"使用提示","children":[{"object":"text","value":"使用提示"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"运行安装器，选择安装位置并允许管理员权限。所需的 WinFsp 运行时会按需自动安装，提示重启时请先重启电脑。"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"双击 FIN 或将它拖入窗口，会将外部文件移动到游戏库；使用“添加游戏”按钮则会复制入库并保留源文件。"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"加密归档入库时不需要密码，首次启动时再输入。请妥善保管密码；备份游戏进度时，应保留完整的 library 文件夹。"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"具体操作与注意事项请查看程序附带的“使用说明.txt”。"}]},{"object":"heading","depth":2,"anchor":"vnmt-更新日志","children":[{"object":"text","value":"VNMT 更新日志"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"版本：1.3 日期：2026-10-06"}]},{"object":"list","is_ordered":false,"start":null,"is_spread":true,"children":[{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"主窗口默认和最大尺寸统一为 1280 × 1024。每次启动恢复默认尺寸，仍可缩小、最小化；小屏幕和高缩放下自动适配可用区域。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"“加入我们”海报按窗口可用空间等比例完整显示，不裁剪。单张海报无需滚动，多张海报仍可滚动查看。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"收藏按钮改用矢量星形，避免更换字体后星号变形。未收藏时为空心星，收藏后为黄色实心星；切换收藏保留当前游戏页面。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"“添加游戏”改为移动入库，与双击、拖入共用校验流程；已在库内的 FIN 不移动。添加补丁后窗口保持打开，可继续添加。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"显示完整补丁目录与可展开的文件列表。删除补丁改为勾选文件或文件夹后确认删除，未选中的补丁保留。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"没有补丁时弹窗提示。目录被外部修改时要求刷新后重新勾选，操作失败保留原补丁。"}]}]},{"object":"list_item","is_checked":null,"children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"保留前三次游玩的存档，如果你不小心误删了之前游玩的存档（这个可能性比较小，因为存档是映射文件），可以通过设置恢复之前保存的三次存档备份，但是如果程序是外部保存存档，比如C盘的Document对应文件夹下是无法进行备份的，因为这些是程序自行对磁盘进行IO操作，不经过程序映射。"}]}]}]}]},"contributors":[{"object":"user","id":"135362","name":"FinSAMA","avatar":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/43/f6/43f62977a1c449a1c32c9a1f1b65b65f4c7d7acbecd7d68454cdf83b5307d81f.webp","hash":"43f62977a1c449a1c32c9a1f1b65b65f4c7d7acbecd7d68454cdf83b5307d81f","width":null,"height":null,"thumbhash":null,"sexual":null},"avatar_frame":null}],"toolset_resources":[{"object":"toolset_resource","id":"181","toolset_resource_type":"file","archive":{"file_size":76560285},"link":null,"note":"VNMT-v1.3","download_count":19,"poster":{"object":"user","id":"135362","name":"FinSAMA","avatar":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/43/f6/43f62977a1c449a1c32c9a1f1b65b65f4c7d7acbecd7d68454cdf83b5307d81f.webp","hash":"43f62977a1c449a1c32c9a1f1b65b65f4c7d7acbecd7d68454cdf83b5307d81f","width":null,"height":null,"thumbhash":null,"sexual":null},"avatar_frame":null},"created_at":"2026-10-07T06:24:34Z","viewer":null},{"object":"toolset_resource","id":"180","toolset_resource_type":"file","archive":{"file_size":76551329},"link":null,"note":"VNMT-v1.2","download_count":34,"poster":{"object":"user","id":"135362","name":"FinSAMA","avatar":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/43/f6/43f62977a1c449a1c32c9a1f1b65b65f4c7d7acbecd7d68454cdf83b5307d81f.webp","hash":"43f62977a1c449a1c32c9a1f1b65b65f4c7d7acbecd7d68454cdf83b5307d81f","width":null,"height":null,"thumbhash":null,"sexual":null},"avatar_frame":null},"created_at":"2026-10-05T17:33:33Z","viewer":null}],"viewer":null}
